DTSTAMP:20261109T103945Z
DTSTART:20261109T194000Z
DTEND:20261109T203000Z
SUMMARY:Jim Fan (NVIDIA) · World Action Models and Agentic Robotics
LOCATION:JW Marriott · conference viewing room
DESCRIPTION:Join the JW Marriott stream at 1:40 p.m. to catch the start. Ji
 m Fan announced 1:45 p.m. and NVIDIA lists 1:50 p.m. Austin time. Covers w
 orld action models\, robot foundation models\, and how video\, robot data 
 and simulation support training. The 2:30 p.m. end is a planning estimate.
  Check Cvent for the exact slot.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/events/corl/
END:VEVENT
